# Plants API endpoint, used ONLY by the Vite dev server to proxy /api/* during local
# development (see vite.config.ts) — only its origin is used. In production the site and
# the API share an origin, so the browser calls /api/* directly and this isn't needed.
# Copy this file to .env and set the value for your environment.
PLANTS_API_URL=https://your-plants-api-host/api/plants

# CARTO basemap API key (free tier), required as of their API key rollout. Get one at
# https://carto.com/basemaps/apikey/ — it's inlined into the client bundle at build time
# (SvelteKit PUBLIC_ convention), matching CARTO's own documented client-side usage.
PUBLIC_CARTO_API_KEY=your-carto-api-key
